<title>USA: Virginia Port Authority rated A1 by Moody's.</title>
<headline>Virginia Port Authority rated A1 by Moody's.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service Inc. said Monday it assigned an A1 rating to Virginia Port Authority port facilities revenue bonds.</p>
<p>The authority plans to sell $100.7 million revenue bonds on May 15, Moody's said. The outlook on the credit is stable.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
